    "created_at": "2018-04-27T20:28:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-27T20:28:11Z",
    "body": "Yeah, agreed that we'd need to be careful introducing limits that are orders of magnitude smaller than what implementations currently happen to allow. But I do think it's worth trying to have such explicit limits for as many APIs as possible.",
