    "created_at": "2018-04-30T16:12:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-30T16:12:31Z",
    "body": "> Do all of the potential candidates want DOMString?\r\n\r\nAs opposed to USVString or ByteString? So far, yes. We've definitely had implementation bugs in various APIs where UTF-8 conversion was done internally, but I'm not aware of any cases where we flipped a spec to USVString.",
