    "created_at": "2018-05-04T16:35:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-04T16:35:38Z",
    "body": "For the record, I assume the path forward here is for a willing engine to annotate potential strings in the API with a non-standard extended attribute and gather metrics on the lengths. With that data, we'll have confidence about the compatibility of doing this.\r\n\r\nWe should compile a list of targets. I suppose all *Strings are candidates. Only 1600 or so methods/dict entries/writable attributes found in Blink to inspect - wheeee!\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
